[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     84[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    match. Confirmed the reference does not diverge under optimization either: a
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     85[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    throwaway `-O3` build of `c_src` (out-of-source, in `/tmp`, `c_src` untouched)
